<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Escelsa 9-mo net higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Escelsa 9-mo net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian power utility company Escelsa, based in Espirito Santo state, has issued the following statement on its nine-month results.</p>
<p>		    9-MO 96			9-MO 95</p>
<p>    net profit  65.2 mln		     768,000</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
</text>
